## ObjectType: Stock Reservation

Local operational extension; no equivalent GS1 class asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| reservation_id | Reservation id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | reservation_id |
| line_id | Line id | string | Foreign key to order_lines; blank creates no edge. | line_id |
| lot_id | Lot id | string | Foreign key to lots; blank creates no edge. | lot_id |
| location_id | Location id | string | Foreign key to locations; blank creates no edge. | location_id |
| quantity | Quantity | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | quantity |
| effective_from | Effective from | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | effective_from |
| effective_to | Effective to | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | effective_to |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | known_date |

